  note      = {the gentlest correct introduction to the cost model},
  note-zh   = {对这套成本模型最平易而正确的入门},
  tldr    = {The gentlest correct introduction to GPU performance: every workload is memory-bound, compute-bound, or overhead-bound, and fusion is the most important optimization a deep-learning compiler performs.},
